    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RSS Digest\n\nFetches a feed, renders the items as a clean HTML page,\nand delivers it two ways:\n  • Scheduled -> daily digest by email\n  • On demand -> GET /digest in the browser\n\nFlow: RSS -> trim fields -> aggregate -> HTML template\n      -> binary file -> respond / send\n\nSwap the URL in RSS Read to point at any feed.\n\nBuilt with n8n · Naji El Kotob",
        "height": 432,
        "width": 304
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -624,
        0
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "a01ccd5f-e841-42b5-b6cb-9c72cdcd6209",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "options": {}
      },
